   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 268\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig\" role=\"img\">\n<ellipse cx=\"148\" cy=\"62\" rx=\"66\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M 82 202 A 66 25 0 0 0 214 202\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M 82 202 A 66 25 0 0 1 214 202\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/>\n<line x1=\"82.00\" y1=\"62.00\" x2=\"82.00\" y2=\"202.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"214.00\" y1=\"62.00\" x2=\"214.00\" y2=\"202.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"148.00\" y1=\"62.00\" x2=\"214.00\" y2=\"62.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"148.00\" cy=\"62.00\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n<text x=\"181.00\" y=\"54.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">r</text>\n<line x1=\"246.00\" y1=\"62.00\" x2=\"246.00\" y2=\"202.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"240.00\" y1=\"62.00\" x2=\"252.00\" y2=\"62.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"240.00\" y1=\"202.00\" x2=\"252.00\" y2=\"202.00\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<text x=\"260.00\" y=\"137.00\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">h</text>\n<text x=\"258\" y=\"34\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">NOT TO</text>\n<text x=\"258\" y=\"54\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"16\">SCALE</text>\n</svg>",
   "stem": "<p>The diagram shows a solid cylinder of radius <i>r</i>&nbsp;cm and height <i>h</i>&nbsp;cm.<br>Its volume is <i>V</i>&nbsp;cm\u00b3 and its total surface area is <i>A</i>&nbsp;cm\u00b2.</p>",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Show that&nbsp; <i>A</i> = 2&pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2 + <sup>2<i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub><i>r</i></sub>.",
     "ans": "",
     "m": 2
    },
    {
     "t": "Calculate <i>A</i> when <i>r</i> = 5 and <i>V</i> = 900. Give your answer correct to 3 significant figures.",
     "ans": "<i>A</i> =",
     "unit": "cm<sup>2</sup>",
     "m": 2
    },
    {
     "t": "Calculate <i>V</i> when <i>A</i> = 250 and <i>r</i> = 4. Give your answer correct to 3 significant figures.",
     "ans": "<i>V</i> =",
     "unit": "cm<sup>3</sup>",
     "m": 2
    }
   ],
   "ms": [
    [
     "<i>A</i> = 2&pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2 + <sup>2<i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub><i>r</i></sub>",
     "2",
     "M1 for <i>A</i> = 2&pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2 + 2&pi;<i>rh</i> and <i>h</i> = <sup><i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>&pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2</sub> both seen<br>A1 for correct substitution and cancelling, nfww"
    ],
    [
     "517 or 517.0\u2026",
     "2",
     "M1 for 2&pi; \u00d7 5\u00b2 or 157.0\u2026 seen, or <sup>2 \u00d7 900</sup>&frasl;<sub>5</sub> or 360 seen<br>A1"
    ],
    [
     "299 or 298.9\u2026",
     "2",
     "M1 for <sup>2<i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>4</sub> = 250 &minus; 2&pi; \u00d7 4\u00b2 or 149.4\u2026 seen<br>A1"
    ]
   ],
   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "Total surface area = 2 circular ends + curved surface",
      "<i>A</i> = 2&pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2 + 2&pi;<i>rh</i>"
     ],
     [
      "<i>V</i> = &pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2<i>h</i>, so <i>h</i> = <sup><i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>&pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2</sub>",
      "make <i>h</i> the subject of the volume formula"
     ],
     [
      "2&pi;<i>rh</i> = 2&pi;<i>r</i> \u00d7 <sup><i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>&pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2</sub> = <sup>2<i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub><i>r</i></sub>",
      "&pi; and one factor of <i>r</i> cancel"
     ],
     [
      "<b><i>A</i> = 2&pi;<i>r</i>\u00b2 + <sup>2<i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub><i>r</i></sub></b>",
      "as required"
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "<i>A</i> = 2&pi; \u00d7 5\u00b2 + <sup>2 \u00d7 900</sup>&frasl;<sub>5</sub>",
      "substitute <i>r</i> = 5 and <i>V</i> = 900"
     ],
     [
      "<i>A</i> = 157.079\u2026 + 360 = 517.079\u2026",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "<i>A</i> = <b>517 cm\u00b2</b> (3 s.f.)",
      "exact value 50&pi; + 360"
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "250 = 2&pi; \u00d7 4\u00b2 + <sup>2<i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>4</sub>",
      "substitute <i>A</i> = 250 and <i>r</i> = 4"
     ],
     [
      "<sup>2<i>V</i></sup>&frasl;<sub>4</sub> = 250 &minus; 100.530\u2026 = 149.469\u2026",
      "subtract 32&pi; from both sides"
     ],
     [
      "<i>V</i> = <sup>4 \u00d7 149.469\u2026</sup>&frasl;<sub>2</sub> = 298.93\u2026",
